    "detailed_description": "<h1>Other Good Games</h1><p><br></p><br><h1>Other Good Games</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948470/extras/343ae65455d6194379ad423bcfb478e3.webp?t=1751126323\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a romantic Adventure Game </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players unfold the story from Moffts' point of view.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the dark night at the office, Mofft is gradually overwhelmed by the reality of his grave mistake. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The loss of life, everything, as if the world had abandoned this woman\u2500\u2500Lasling stands quietly at the end of the corridor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Though the two sides are constantly entangled by the past, they turn out to be each other's redemption.\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948470/extras/f934ccd24e7529e8b8f615a64c30820e.avif?t=1751126323\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;If that accident hadn't happened, would I still have met you?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Even if everything about me is falling apart, would you still stay by my side?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;In the mountain at the back of the company, she still waits for me under the cypress tree.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Even now, faults and mistakes are still blaming me.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Will you be able to find happiness just by going to the far south?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now, let's indulge in this bitter and unforgettable love together</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948470/extras/1913350170f6f5710434869c36b56e20.poster.avif?t=1751126323\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948470/extras/1913350170f6f5710434869c36b56e20.webm?t=1751126323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948470/extras/1913350170f6f5710434869c36b56e20.mp4?t=1751126323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948470/extras/fbd20dcb2214e09a3e2747f5d2686955.webp?t=1751126323\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ASMR voices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">60+ basic CGs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Check out heroines in different outfits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deep and touching pure love story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20+ original soundtracks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 80 kinds of sound effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Live2D animations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948470/extras/b63fa0e57b129ba1d059b5772e26e0ee.avif?t=1751126323\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lots of CG special effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948470/extras/d7e221486a6ffda6907645db997620cf.poster.avif?t=1751126323\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948470/extras/d7e221486a6ffda6907645db997620cf.webm?t=1751126323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948470/extras/d7e221486a6ffda690